  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "マリルを　モチーフにした　ボール。やわらかくて　よく弾む。　間違って本物のマリルを　投げないよう　注意。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "마릴을 모티브로 만든 볼. 말랑말랑하고 잘 튀어 오른다. 실수로 진짜 마릴을 던지지 않게 주의하자.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以瑪力露為主題，設計而成的球。柔軟而有彈性。小心別誤把真的瑪力露當成球丟出去。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ballon doux et rebondissant qui ressemble comme deux gouttes d’eau à un Marill. Faites attention à ne pas le confondre avec le vrai !",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein weicher Ball im Marill-Design mit großer Sprungkraft. Hüte dich davor, aus Versehen ein echtes Marill anstelle des Balles zu werfen!",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Esta pelota es blandita y rebota muy bien, pero se parece tanto a Marill que hay que andarse con ojo para no confundirse y lanzar a un Marill de verdad por error.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Palla ispirata a Marill. È morbida e rimbalza bene. Attenzione a non lanciare per sbaglio un vero Marill al posto di questa palla.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A Marill-themed ball. It’s soft and springy. Make sure you haven’t mistaken a real Marill for this ball before throwing.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "マリルを　モチーフにした　ボール。やわらかくて　よく弾む。　間違って本物のマリルを　投げないよう　注意。",
